  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "¡Aaah!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10041006100610068002100100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 11
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>봆<U+0000>Pero si eres <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>...\n¿Q-qué quieres?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 636,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BD060000005000650072006F0020007300690020006500720065007300200010000201000000002E002E002E000A00BF0051002D0071007500E900200071007500690065007200650073003F00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tienes un encargo para mí?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 728,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400690065006E0065007300200075006E00200065006E0063006100720067006F002000700061007200610020006D00ED003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Necesitas ayuda?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 784,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004E00650063006500730069007400610073002000610079007500640061003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué? Ah, ¡claro, disculpa! Tenía la cabeza en\notro lado.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 820,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E9003F002000410068002C002000A10063006C00610072006F002C002000640069007300630075006C007000610021002000540065006E00ED00610020006C006100200063006100620065007A006100200065006E000A006F00740072006F0020006C00610064006F002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quería pedirte que encontraras amigos para\nmi Frigibax, está tan solito...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Friii...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00460072006900690069002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me lo dio mi hermana, que se mudó a Paldea\npara estudiar, pero es taaan tímido...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Me encantaría enseñarle a romper el hielo y\neso, pero yo tampoco soy muy sociable...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Así que quiero que vayas a la zona salvaje 10 y\nhables con los Entrenadores que veas allí.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Lleva a Frigibax a la zona salvaje 10 y habla con\nlos Entrenadores que te encuentres allí para que<U+0010><U+0001>븀\npueda hacer amigos.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 126
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000B>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Sí?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005300ED003F00100002011401D00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Quieres que mi Bergmite se haga amigo de ese\nFrigibax que llevas contigo?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1952,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 79
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Beeerg!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100420065006500650072006700210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tengo entendido que los Bergmite y los Frigibax\nde la región de Paldea se pelean apenas se ven.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "♪¡Bax!♪",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2332,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "266A00A10042006100780021266A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mira, parece que a tu Frigibax le cae bien mi\nBergmite.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2348,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006900720061002C00200070006100720065006300650020007100750065002000610020007400750020004600720069006700690062006100780020006C006500200063006100650020006200690065006E0020006D0069000A0042006500720067006D006900740065002E00100002011401D00000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 60
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Como son de tipo Hielo, no necesitan romper\nel... Digo, ¡seguro que se derretirán de la risa!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2468,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sigue hablando con más Entrenadores!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300690067007500650020006800610062006C0061006E0064006F00200063006F006E0020006D00E1007300200045006E007400720065006E00610064006F00720065007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya hablaste con todos los Entrenadores de\nla zona salvaje 10. Regresa junto a Modestia.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2740,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0015>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2916,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00150000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hola, dime.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2928,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0048006F006C0061002C002000640069006D0065002E00100002011401D10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Ya veo! Quieres que Frigibax y Torchic se hagan\namigos, qué bien.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2960,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A100590061002000760065006F00210020005100750069006500720065007300200071007500650020004600720069006700690062006100780020007900200054006F0072006300680069006300200073006500200068006100670061006E000A0061006D00690067006F0073002C00200071007500E90020006200690065006E002E00100002011401D10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 71
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tooor!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3104,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10054006F006F006F007200210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "A Torchic y a mí nos encanta la naturaleza, y él\nsiempre me ayuda a encender las hogueras.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3120,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué es capaz de hacer Frigibax?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3312,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E900200065007300200063006100700061007A002000640065002000680061006300650072002000460072006900670069006200610078003F00100002011401D10000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Baaax!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10042006100610061007800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Sí que tienes energía, pequeño.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nSeguro que puedes enfriar bebidas, eso nos\nvendría genial al acampar.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 3404,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 109
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sigue hablando con más Entrenadores!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 3624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300690067007500650020006800610062006C0061006E0064006F00200063006F006E0020006D00E1007300200045006E007400720065006E00610064006F00720065007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya hablaste con todos los Entrenadores de\nla zona salvaje 10. Regresa junto a Modestia.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 3700,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 3876,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Qué quieres, eh?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 3888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF0051007500E900200071007500690065007200650073002C002000650068003F00100002011401D20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Zaaan!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 3932,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005A006100610061006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Uah! ¿O sea que ese Frigibax busca amigos?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 3948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10055006100680021002000BF004F00200073006500610020007100750065002000650073006500200046007200690067006900620061007800200062007500730063006100200061006D00690067006F0073003F00100002011401D20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qué coincidencia, yo también quiero que mi\nZangoose haga amigos.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0051007500E900200063006F0069006E0063006900640065006E006300690061002C00200079006F002000740061006D0062006900E9006E002000710075006900650072006F00200071007500650020006D0069000A005A0061006E0067006F006F007300650020006800610067006100200061006D00690067006F0073002E00100002011401D20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 69
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Baaax!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 4184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A10042006100610061007800210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Si a Frigibax le parece bien, seguro que a mi\nZangoose le encantaría ser su amigo.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 4200,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 87
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Sigue hablando con más Entrenadores!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 4376,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005300690067007500650020006800610062006C0061006E0064006F00200063006F006E0020006D00E1007300200045006E007400720065006E00610064006F00720065007300210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ya hablaste con todos los Entrenadores de\nla zona salvaje 10. Regresa junto a Modestia.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 4452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿(",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 4628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00280000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ah, ho-hola... Dime, ¿cómo son los Entrenadores\ncon los que hablaste?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 4640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00410068002C00200068006F002D0068006F006C0061002E002E002E002000440069006D0065002C002000BF006300F3006D006F00200073006F006E0020006C006F007300200045006E007400720065006E00610064006F007200650073000A0063006F006E0020006C006F007300200071007500650020006800610062006C0061007300740065003F00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 74
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Por lo que me cuentas, parecen muy...\ninteresantes.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 4788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0050006F00720020006C006F00200071007500650020006D00650020006300750065006E007400610073002C0020007000610072006500630065006E0020006D00750079002E002E002E000A0069006E007400650072006500730061006E007400650073002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mi hermana me dijo que en la región de\nPaldea los Bergmite y los Frigibax se llevan mal...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 4900,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Naturaleza? ¿Hogueras? Ay, suena peligroso...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 5092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF004E00610074007500720061006C0065007A0061003F002000BF0048006F006700750065007200610073003F002000410079002C0020007300750065006E0061002000700065006C006900670072006F0073006F002E002E002E00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 51
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Zangoose? Ese Pokémon suele pelearse con los\nSeviper y da mucho miedo, ¿no?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 5196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Hmm, no sé, pero creo que voy a dejar de buscar\namigos para Frigibax por ahora...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 5360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 86
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Gracias por hacerme el favor de ir a hablar con\nesos Entrenadores por mí.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 5532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Frigiii!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 48,
      "offsetInSection": 5688,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004600720069006700690069006900210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Frigibax! ¿A qué viene ese grito?<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 49,
      "offsetInSection": 5708,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1004600720069006700690062006100780021002000BF004100200071007500E90020007600690065006E0065002000650073006500200067007200690074006F003F00100002011401CF0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¿Tienes en cuenta sus sentimientos?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 50,
      "offsetInSection": 5788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00BF005400690065006E0065007300200065006E0020006300750065006E007400610020007300750073002000730065006E00740069006D00690065006E0074006F0073003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quieres a Frigibax, ¿verdad?",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 51,
      "offsetInSection": 5860,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100750069006500720065007300200061002000460072006900670069006200610078002C002000BF007600650072006400610064003F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "P-por supuesto, pero... es que... me cuesta\nmucho hablar con otras personas...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǏ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 52,
      "offsetInSection": 5920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Hola! Tú debes ser la Entrenadora de Frigibax.\n¿Qué tal si dejas que juegue con mi Bergmite?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǐ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 53,
      "offsetInSection": 6088,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Tengo tantas ganas de acampar con tu\nFrigibax que vine a buscarlos a los dos!<U+0010><U+0002>ĔǑ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 54,
      "offsetInSection": 6284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 83
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je, nunca vi a mi Zangoose tan contento\ncomo ahora.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕǒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 55,
      "offsetInSection": 6452,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004A0065002C0020006E0075006E00630061002000760069002000610020006D00690020005A0061006E0067006F006F00730065002000740061006E00200063006F006E00740065006E0074006F000A0063006F006D006F002000610068006F00720061002E00100002011401D20000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 56
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Zaaan!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 56,
      "offsetInSection": 6564,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00A1005A006100610061006E00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "¡Baaax!",
